bureaucracy and the little guy forced to navigate it</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >4 levels packed full of charming characters and challenging platforming puzzles</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >REALLY good jokes</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hundreds of collectibles</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >An undead pigeon</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A zany yet wonderful soundtrack</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
